  "text": "Career Page\nBy continuing to use and navigate this website, you are agreeing to the use of cookies.\nAccept Close\n\t\t\t\nLanguage  \nLogin\n\t\nDefine your future at Eterno Infotech\n\nSales & Marketing\n\nContent Creators\n\nMonetization\n\nOperations\n\nInternship\n\nView all openings\n\nInnovators, leaders, and\npassionate collaborators.\nA team dedicated to making a significant impact.\n\nWe are setting new standards and benchmarks every day to bring life to every new update. We\nare on the streak to create an impact, to bring new scoops from across the globe to let our\nusers have the thunder of knowing it first. Our aim is to provide first-hand information with the\nbest in technology to reduce the divide that the new edge Bharat needs. We are here to conquer\nthe industry with latest technology and best-in-class talent.\n\n \n \n \nA Conscious Organization that Outperforms\n\nWe are inspired by a conscious culture,” which leads us to create policies\nand processes to empower your personal and professional growth.\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n×\nDisclaimer\n\nIt has come to our notice that fake job offers are being offered on behalf of Eterno Infotech Private Limited (\"Eterno”) by certain individuals/entities claiming they are representatives, subsidiaries or under contract with Eterno. Eterno does not:\n\n1. Send job offers from free email services like Gmail, Rediffmail, Yahoo mail, Hotmail, etc.\n2. Request payment of any kind from prospective candidates for employment.\n3. Authorize anyone to collect money or arrive at any monetary arrangement in return for a job at Eterno.\nHowever, in cases when the recruitment process is done through professional recruiting agencies, offers are always made directly by Eterno.\nPlease note that Eterno:\n1. Will not be responsible to anyone acting on an employment offer not directly made by Eterno.\n2. Has not authorised anyone to make an employment offer and any such offer extended is not for an approved job.\n3. Reserves the right to take legal action, including criminal action, against such individuals/entities\n\"If you receive any unauthorized, suspicious or fraudulent offers or interview call, Please write an email to us at hr@eternoinfotech.com. All official emails from Eterno would have a domain @eternoinfotech.com\"\n\n\nClick here to acknwoledge\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and Conditions\nContent Policy\nGrievance\nUser Agreement\nTakedown Policy\nEterno Infotech Pvt Ltd\nPrestige Tech Park III Valence,\n2nd Floor, 1, Kariyammana Agrahara Rd,\nKadubeesanahalli, Marathahalli,\nBengaluru, Karnataka, 560037\n\n© 2021 - Eterno Infotech Pvt. Ltd",
